OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FClear spells
OL,6,Fand scattered showers in the evening,
OL,7,Foccasionally heavy in the west.
OL,8,FTurning mostly dry overnight as
OL,9,Fshowers become lighter and more
OL,10,Fisolated. Fresh to strong winds
OL,11,Fgradually ease.
OL,12,
OL,13,CSaturday:FMostly dry and bright with
OL,14,Fgood sunny spells, but somewhat
OL,15,Fcloudier in the afternoon with the
OL,16,Fchance of the odd shower. Fresh winds
OL,17,Fat first will soon become light.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
